  "title": "Teradata’s ClearScape Analytics Shows Nearly 250% ROI, According to Total Economic Impact Study",
  "summary": "Customers of Teradata’s ClearScape Analytics experienced increased profitability through a notable improvement in data scientist productivity, faster time-to-market, scaling of artificial intelligence/machine learning (AI/ML) model deployment, and more. Those were among the conclusions announced today in a Forrester Consulting Total Economic ImpactTM (TEI) study commissioned by Teradata.",
